{"id":"n28375-1-11","stage":1,"title":"단추 · 扣子","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28375-1-11-1","ko":"이 셔츠의 단추가 떨어졌어요.","zh":"这件衬衫的扣子掉了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"셔츠의","meaning":"衬衫","explanation":"셔츠：衬衫；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64284","senseId":"1","lemma":"셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단추가","meaning":"扣子，纽扣","explanation":"단추：扣子，纽扣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"단추","audio":"/audio/8ab17bb5575e5c161e5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28375","senseId":"1","lemma":"단추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어졌어요.","meaning":"掉下，断开","explanation":"떨어지다：掉下，断开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"11","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"0f9ab32a190bfc01","term":"셔츠","zh":"衬衫","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3","entryId":"64284","definition":"可穿在西装内，也可外穿的西式上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8ab17bb5575e5c16","term":"단추","zh":"扣子，纽扣","audio":"/audio/8ab17bb5575e5c161e5f.mp3","entryId":"28375","definition":"为了扣好衣服而使用的圆形小物品。","pronunciation":["단추"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"掉下，断开","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"挂或贴在一起的东西被分开或分离。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f1354cb87956386c2d33.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28375-1-11-2","ko":"이리 주세요. 제가 바느질해서 다시 달아 드릴게요.","zh":"请给我吧，我帮您缝上再装回去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바느질해서","meaning":"做针线活","explanation":"바느질하다：做针线活；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"바느질하다","audio":"/audio/6a8e0cba4408d8f7b0ad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56377","senseId":"1","lemma":"바느질하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시","meaning":"又，重新","explanation":"다시：又，重新","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"6","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달아","meaning":"挂，悬，别，带","explanation":"달다：挂，悬，别，带；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64533","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"062801c7a30dc6ce","term":"이리","zh":"往这边，朝这里","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3","entryId":"91328","definition":"向着这个地方；或向着这个方向。","pronunciation":["이리"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"6a8e0cba4408d8f7","term":"바느질하다","zh":"做针线活","audio":"/audio/6a8e0cba4408d8f7b0ad.mp3","entryId":"56377","definition":"在针上穿线缝制或缝补衣服。","pronunciation":["바느질하다"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"又，重新","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"从头开始重做。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"挂，悬，别，带","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"64533","definition":"将物品拴挂或插在某处，使其不掉落。","pronunciation":["달다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f6e3429dec0b00d26db.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.036,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28375","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.6894,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请给我吧，我帮您缝上再装回去。","我打算去你去过那家、说不错的餐厅看看。","这件衬衫的扣子掉了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请给我吧，我帮您缝上再装回去。","这件衬衫的扣子掉了。","我打算去你去过那家、说不错的餐厅看看。"],"answer":0}]}
